    sampleBody: 'As Site Engineer at [Company], I oversee structural execution for a ₹65Cr mixed-use development in Pune, managing 3 supervisors, 12 subcontractors, and a daily labour force of 180 workers. I prepare and review shop drawings in AutoCAD, conduct daily quality inspections per IS 456 specifications, and prepare weekly progress reports for the project director. I track project schedule in Primavera P6 and manage material procurement to maintain a 2-week buffer stock at all times. I have also completed my CPWD empanelment for structural supervision.',
