    sampleOpening: 'I negotiated ₹3.8Cr in annual procurement savings at [Company] through vendor consolidation, long-term contracts, and specification standardisation — without compromising quality standards or supply reliability. This combination of commercial discipline and supply continuity focus is what I bring to supply chain leadership.',
